    "science_nad": {
      "type": "muto-home-science",
      "blocks": {
        "sp1": {
          "type": "panel",
          "settings": {
            "label": "What it does",
            "title": "What it does",
            "text": "<p>MUTO NAD+ Cellular Complex supports the cellular system underneath your energy and recovery: the one your wearable reports on every morning but can't see. It's designed for energy that holds through the day, recovery between sessions, and the repair work your cells run overnight. Two capsules, 19 ingredients, one daily protocol.</p>",
            "cta_label": "Start the protocol",
            "cta_link": "/products/muto-nad-cellular-complex"
          }
        },
        "sp2": {
          "type": "panel",
          "settings": {
            "label": "How it works",
            "title": "How it works",
            "text": "<p>Your cells run on NAD+. It's how they turn food into energy, and how they fund the repair work that keeps you recovering. The harder you train, work and live, the more they use, and supply tends to fall as you get older. MUTO works in three parts:</p><ul><li>Produce gives your cells what they need to make NAD+.</li><li>Protect looks after the cells doing the work.</li><li>Put to work helps turn it into energy you can actually use.</li></ul><p>Your wearable shows the output. MUTO is the input.</p>",
            "cta_label": "Start the protocol",
            "cta_link": ""
          }
        },
        "sp3": {
          "type": "panel",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Formula",
            "title": "Formula",
            "text": "<p>19 ingredients, every dose on the label. No proprietary blends &amp; filler free.</p><ul><li>NAD+ building blocks. Nicotinamide Riboside 300mg · TMG 450mg. NR is a form of vitamin B3 your cells use to make NAD+.</li><li>Energy and tiredness. Methylated B vitamins, including methylfolate 400µg, methylcobalamin 100µg and P5P 5mg. The active forms, which contribute to normal energy-yielding metabolism and the reduction of tiredness and fatigue.</li><li>Cell protection, immunity and muscle. Zinc 15mg · Copper 1mg · Vitamin D3 50µg (2,000 IU) · Vitamin K2 (MK-7) 100µg. They contribute to the protection of cells from oxidative stress, normal immune function and normal muscle function.</li><li>Plant and mitochondrial compounds. CoQ10 150mg · PQQ 20mg · Grape seed extract 150mg · Trans-resveratrol 50mg · BioPerine 5mg.</li></ul>",
            "cta_label": "Start the protocol",
            "cta_link": ""
          }
        },
        "sp4": {
          "type": "panel",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Who it's for",
            "title": "Who it's for",
            "text": "<p>People who already do the work — the training, the sleep, the food — and want it to show. If your afternoons fade, sessions take longer to bounce back from, or your numbers have stopped moving, MUTO is built for you. It's not for anyone chasing a buzz: no caffeine, no stimulants.</p>",
            "cta_label": "Start the protocol",
            "cta_link": ""
          }
        },
        "sp5": {
          "type": "panel",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Protocol",
            "title": "Protocol",
            "text": "<p>Two capsules with your first meal, every day. Before you start, take your seven-day average: HRV, resting heart rate, recovery. Keep the rest of your routine steady, pick your check-in date, and judge the trend over 60 to 90 days. Your data, your call. If you don't see a difference, you're covered.</p>",
            "cta_label": "Start the protocol",
            "cta_link": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "sp1",
        "sp2",
        "sp3",
        "sp4",
        "sp5"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "flip": false,
        "heading": "The science:\nNAD+ Cellular\nComplex",
        "lede": "What's happening beneath the surface, and why it shows up in the numbers you already track.",
        "tablist_label": "Choose a topic",
        "image_fallback": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0976/2724/2843/files/muto-science-nad-v2.jpg?v=1791288517",
        "image_alt": "Two jars of MUTO NAD+ Cellular Complex, one tipped against the other, lit on a dark set",
        "space_top": 100,
        "space_bottom": 100
      }
    },
    "science_creatine": {
      "type": "muto-home-science",
      "blocks": {
        "sp1": {
          "type": "panel",
          "settings": {
            "label": "What it does",
            "title": "What it does",
            "text": "<p>Creatine is the fast reserve your muscles draw on when effort spikes: the hard rep, the sprint, the last station. It helps you repeat hard efforts with less drop-off, so you get more out of every session. It's one of the most researched supplements there is, and now it's in the same routine as your NAD+ Cellular Complex.</p>",
            "cta_label": "Start Now",
            "cta_link": "/products/muto-creatine"
          }
        },
        "sp2": {
          "type": "panel",
          "settings": {
            "label": "How it works",
            "title": "How it works",
            "text": "<p>At the start of a sprint, a heavy lift or a steep climb, your muscles burn through their ready supply of ATP in seconds, faster than your mitochondria can remake it. Creatine is stored in muscle as phosphocreatine, a reserve that rebuilds ATP almost instantly, so the next rep, stride or effort has something to draw on. MUTO NAD+ Cellular Complex looks after the steady supply. Creatine looks after the fast reserve. Two energy systems, one routine.</p>",
            "cta_label": "Start Now",
            "cta_link": "/products/muto-creatine"
          }
        },
        "sp3": {
          "type": "panel",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Formula",
            "title": "Formula",
            "text": "<p>Ultrapure creatine monohydrate, the most studied form, and nothing else in the tub. It's micronised into a finer powder, so it mixes cleanly into water, coffee or a smoothie with no grit. ≥99.9% pure, every batch tested. The same standard as everything we make: nothing hidden.</p>",
            "cta_label": "Start Now",
            "cta_link": "/products/muto-creatine"
          }
        },
        "sp4": {
          "type": "panel",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Who it's for",
            "title": "Who it's for",
            "text": "<p>For people who train to stay strong for longer: the Hyrox athlete chasing faster stations, the fifty-something lifting to keep up with his kids, the woman who knows strength training isn't just for bodybuilders. MUTO NAD+ Cellular Complex supports the steady energy you run on all day. MUTO Ultrapure Creatine Monohydrate supports the fast reserve your muscles draw on when effort spikes.</p>",
            "cta_label": "Start Now",
            "cta_link": "/products/muto-creatine"
          }
        },
        "sp5": {
          "type": "panel",
          "settings": {
            "label": "Protocol",
            "title": "Protocol",
            "text": "<p>One 5g scoop a day, every day, with your first meal alongside your NAD+ Cellular Complex capsules. Any drink works. Consistency beats timing, so there's no loading and no cycling. Stores build over a few weeks, and the scales may nudge up slightly as your muscles hold more water. That's expected, and it isn't fat. Track it where it shows: note your reps at a set weight, interval splits or station times before your first scoop, and compare after a few weeks.</p>",
            "cta_label": "Start Now",
            "cta_link": "/products/muto-creatine"
          }
        }
      },
